+# FoldKeyboard 0.1 — experimental HeliBoard fork
+
+Left trackpad, right phone-sized keyboard, and a rootless accessibility pointer in one app.
+Based on HeliBoard v4.1. See [setup, build instructions and verification status](FOLDKEYBOARD.md).
+The source is implemented; a full Android build and physical-device validation are still pending.
+Scroll and drag replay after finger release. The pointer is active while the keyboard is visible.
+
